  silhouetteMimic: {fileID: 7363729202824495390, guid: c846e9f61885e3f4fbe414515cbf61aa, type: 3}
  voiceBlip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9b3d83f382761154493270e7d885aec4, type: 3}
  visitorName: Avaline
  birthYear: 1953
  birthMonth: 7
  birthDay: 22
  personality: Upbeat, happy, jovial
  note: 'Enteeed the park 6 days ago with her brother as part of a backpacking trip.
    Avaline upbeat jovial personality and is known by her friends to be very sociable.
    She  has a close brother named Dasni  '
  genuineGreeting: I'm trying to find my Brother, his name is Dasni. Have you heard
    from him? We got separated after part of the path gave way in a mudslide but
    he told me he'd find a way to get around.
  mimicGreeting: "Hello? I\u2019m at the gate."
  genuineClosing: "Thanks! If you hear from Dasni, tell him that I\u2019ll meet him
    at the hotel."
  mimicClosing: "Thanks! Let me know if my brother gets out, alright, since I think
    he\u2019s the one that has the car keys."
  genuineRejected: "Well I guess I\u2019ll just die here with him then!\n.... Ok.
    Do keep an eye out for Dasni tho won't you?"
  mimicRejected: "Well I guess I\u2019ll just die here with him then."
  genuineNameResponse: "The name\u2019s Avaline! My brother\u2019s Dasni, if he comes
    \u2018round."
  genuineBirthdayResponse: 'I had my 38th exactly 1 week before me and my brother
    came to the park. '
  genuineReasonResponse: "We booked the trip to celebrate since we both love the
    outdoors so much.... \nDear god this trip was a mistake! Wish we had\u2019nt
    this trip.\r\nAnd now I keep hearing all these Weird noises I think somethings
    been following me."
  genuineTimeResponse: "My brother and I have been backpacking through the park since
    last monday. We ended up getting separated after part of the trail gave way in
    a mudslide. \nHe told me to head to the exit and promised that he would find
    away around and meet up with me. That was a few hours ago and I still haven't
    seen him and I'm really worried about him. Especially with the winds starting
    to pick up."
  mimicNameResponse: "The name\u2019s Avaline! My brother\u2019s Dasni, if he comes
    \u2018round."
  mimicBirthdayResponse: I actually had my 38th exactly 9 days before me and my brother
    came to the park! We booked the trip to celebrate since we both love the outdoors
    so much.
  mimicReasonResponse: To go backpacking!
  mimicTimeResponse: "I entered the park last wednesday and I\u2019ve been backpacking
    with my brother. We ended up getting separated after he fell off a cliff. I\u2019m
    kind of traumatized, but it\u2019s chill!"
